WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:04.045
It just exploded nationwide.

00:00:04.045 --> 00:00:05.463
It was a cultural phenomenon.

00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:07.674
What color is happier
than purple?

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:09.300
No color.

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:11.011
This is Barney, and

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.178
this is what he sounded like.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:14.848
Barney stands for inclusion,

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.224
acceptance.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:17.308
You should love everyone.

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:18.226
We all have Sheryl Leach

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:19.185
to thank for that.

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:21.521
As her beloved character

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.064
was heading into 
the stratosphere,

00:00:23.064 --> 00:00:24.190
people couldn't accept

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.859
that this was just a show.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.028
And so, let the bashing begin.

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:30.530
Some of the rumors that I heard:

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:32.365
Barney hides drugs in his tail.

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:33.992
They were violent and explicit.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:35.869
Death and dismemberment

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:36.828
of my family.

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:38.413
I love you, Barney!

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:39.330
They were gonna come and find me

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.749
and they were going to kill me.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:42.500
Just the dark side

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.918
of this whole moment.

00:00:43.918 --> 00:00:46.588
That must have 
devastated Sheryl.

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:48.548
There was something larger

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.299
going on here.

00:00:51.342 --> 00:00:52.177
I don't think you could ever

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:53.553
think somebody would

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.680
go and shoot someone.

